      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POWER UP NZ (3) scored at Launceston two runs ago before having his colours lowered when second at his latest appearance over 2090m at this track, beaten 3.5 metres. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Meets a comparable field and he can give this a mighty shake. GO THE RED (2) did a fine job last time over 1680m at Launceston, finishing second and just 1.4 metres from the winner after locking wheels in the run home. Will relish the return to this track where he is yet to have his colours lowered in three starts. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Good enough to put himself back in the winners' stall. CUSTOM HARLEY (5) finished fifth last start over 2090m at this track. Generally runs very well at this circuit so can play a big role. WAVES OF CHANCE (1) is next best and gets every chance from a favourable draw.",
